      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "wish you luck on your",
      "translation" : "祝你在新的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "new life's journey.",
      "translation" : "人生旅途中一切顺利。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, venture forth and seek those who need your help. May God light your path.",
      "translation" : "现在，去寻找需要你帮助的人吧。愿神照亮你的道路。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, venture forth to seek people who need your help. May God enlighten your way.",
      "translation" : "现在，去寻找需要你帮助的人吧。愿神指引你的道路。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I sense that you have endured a past life experience. You must have learned many things before entering Valhalla.",
      "translation" : "我感觉到你经历过前世的历练。在进入英灵殿之前，你一定学到了许多东西。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "However, I can tell that you are not suited to be an Acolyte. Please remember who you were in your past life and find your path.",
      "translation" : "不过，我看得出你并不适合成为服事。请回想前世的自己，找到属于你的道路。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What is it that you seek?",
      "translation" : "你想要什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Change your job to acolyte.",
      "translation" : "转职为服事"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ask the requirements to be an acolyte.",
      "translation" : "询问服事的转职条件"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Quit it.",
      "translation" : "离开"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you feeling okay today? I can tell by your attire that you are already an Acolyte. You're not joking around, are you?",
      "translation" : "你今天还好吗？看你的打扮，已经是服事了吧。你不是在开玩笑吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry but it seems you already have your own job, aren't you?",
      "translation" : "抱歉，你似乎已经有自己的职业了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you truly wish to become a servant of God?",
      "translation" : "你真的愿意成为神的仆人吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let's see whether you are ready for it or not... Hmm...",
      "translation" : "让我看看你是否已经准备好了...嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh my?! You haven't accomplished the basic practice yet?! You have a long way to go! Come again after increasing your job level!",
      "translation" : "哎呀！你还没完成基础修行吗？！你还差得远呢！提升职业等级后再来吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... your job level is enough...",
      "translation" : "嗯...你的职业等级够了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good. Now I will give you the qualification to become an Acolyte.",
      "translation" : "很好。现在我将授予你成为服事的资格。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Always remember to be thankful to God, who takes care of us all the time. In chaos and times of difficulty, face your hardships with unwavering faith.",
      "translation" : "要时刻感念神对我们的照拂。无论身处混乱还是困境，都要以坚定的信仰面对艰难。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Lastly, I want to sincerely congratulate you on persevering through your trial of penance.",
      "translation" : "最后，衷心祝贺你坚持完成了苦修试炼。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you wish to become an Acolyte?",
      "translation" : "你想成为服事吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then, you must fulfill the following requirements thinking those are the practices given by God.",
      "translation" : "那么，请把以下要求视作神赐予的修行，并逐一完成。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "First, you have to reach at least Novice Job Level 9 and learn all of the Basic Skills.",
      "translation" : "首先，初心者职业等级必须达到9级，并学会所有基本技能。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is the most basic thing to do, so you need to regard it as the way of training yourself.",
      "translation" : "这是最基本的要求，请把它当作磨炼自己的方式。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Mareusis]",
      "translation" : "[马雷修斯神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Cleric",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When you think you fulfilled this requirement, then come back to me again. Then you will have a holy job in which you can spread God's will.",
      "translation" : "完成这些要求后再来找我。届时你就能成为传扬神意的神圣职业。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please take care. They should know that you've met me by the time you arrive at the Prontera Sanctuary.",
      "translation" : "保重。等你到达普隆德拉圣堂时，他们应该已经知道你来见过我了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I've sent a carrier pigeon with a message. I hope it will arrive there safely...",
      "translation" : "我已经放出信鸽送信，希望它能平安抵达..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh...? You must be the one who aspires to become an Acolyte. I've already received news from the Sanctuary that you might be coming.",
      "translation" : "哦...？你一定就是那位想成为服事的人吧。我已经收到圣堂的消息，说你可能会来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, your name was {0}, right? Excellent, thank you for visiting me.",
      "translation" : "你的名字是{0}，对吧？很好，谢谢你来看我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I believe you've been told much about Acolytes from Friar Mareusis. Plus, there's plenty of helpful people in the Prontera Sanctuary.",
      "translation" : "我想马雷修斯修士已经向你介绍过服事了。况且普隆德拉圣堂里也有很多热心的人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I guess there's really no need for me to teach you much. Besides, I'm sure your someone from your generation may have trouble listening to an old man like me. Hahaha~",
      "translation" : "看来我也没什么需要多教你的了。而且，像你这样的年轻人，大概也听不进我这个老头子的话吧。哈哈哈~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Still, lessons may come from the places you'd least expect. God loves to teach his children in strange ways. You'll see.",
      "translation" : "不过，意想不到的地方也能带来启示。神喜欢用奇妙的方式教导祂的孩子，你会明白的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, I'll send the message telling them that you've come to visit me. So, you may now return to the Prontera Sanctuary.",
      "translation" : "那么，我会送信告诉他们你来见过我了。你现在可以回普隆德拉圣堂了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Farewell.",
      "translation" : "再会。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh...",
      "translation" : "哦..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you one of the",
      "translation" : "你是"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Acolyte applicants...?",
      "translation" : "服事申请者之一吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let's see...",
      "translation" : "我看看..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your name is {0}?",
      "translation" : "你的名字是{0}？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think your name",
      "translation" : "我想你的名字"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "is on my list. Hmmm...",
      "translation" : "不在我的名单上。嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you go back to the Prontera Sanctuary and check again?",
      "translation" : "你回普隆德拉圣堂再确认一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Huh? What brings you here? This is a very dangerous place for a Novice like yourself!",
      "translation" : "咦？你怎么会来这里？对你这样的初心者来说，这里非常危险！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Greetings.",
      "translation" : "你好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]",
      "translation" : "[鲁巴卡拉巴拉神父]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to the Deep. Feel free to sit and contemplate God's message with me. This place is beautiful, even if danger accompanies its sense of serenity...",
      "translation" : "欢迎来到深处。请坐下来，和我一起思索神的教诲。这里很美，宁静之中却也暗藏危险..."
    },
    {
